  "title": "Chipotle Removes Jalapeños From Select Restaurants Amid Salmonella Investigation",
  "summary": "Chipotle Mexican Grill has taken precautionary action by removing certain jalapeños from some of its restaurants following concerns linked to a salmonella investigation. The company announced that it identified jalapeños as a possible common ingredient connected to illnesses being examined by public health officials. The move comes after health authorities in Minnesota reported a growing number of salmonella cases among individuals who had recently eaten at Chipotle locations and other Mexican-",
